    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="14">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 14</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{XIIII} Gif mon sie dumb oððe déaf geboren, þæt he ne mæge synna onsecggan ne geandettan, bete se fæder his misdæda.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a person is born dumb or deaf, so that he cannot deny nor confess his offenses, let the father compensate for his misdeeds.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If anyone is born dumb or deaf, so that he can neither deny nor confess his wrongdoings, his father shall pay compensation for his misdeeds.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">XIIII. Gif mon sy dumb oððe deaf geboren, ðæt he ne mæge synne onsæcgan ne geondettan, bete se fæder his misdæda.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
